invariant: INV-41
file: Makefile
catches: test/widemul-builds.sh
reason: make writes CH_RSA_MONT64_ADX_MODEL for every host object, so
  rsa_mont64_adx.c would read test/rsa_mont64_adx_model.h, portable C in
  place of its five assembly operations, and a session with CH_CPU_BMI2_ADX
  would sign on test code that no library build may hold.
  test/widemul-builds.sh refuses a host object's defines that name it.

--- old
             $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF))
--- new
             $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF) $(if $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF),-DCH_RSA_MONT64_ADX_MODEL))
